1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Hey, guys!

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,160
We might not take down this boss.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,260
But the next one?

4
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,660
I promise.

5
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,180
That one's ours!

6
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,320
Sorry, guys.

7
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,260
Stand down.

8
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,400
You're not getting past me.

9
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,190
Kirito!

10
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,940
You sure you wanna do this, buddy?

11
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,560
It's a bad idea.

12
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,900
I doubt even you can take
on a whore this big solo.

13
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:31,450
Yeah, maybe.

14
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:34,320
There's only one way to find out for sure.

15
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,579
It's your funeral.

16
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,980
Okay, people, you're the man.

17
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,420
Mages, let him have it.

18
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,580
Watch out, Cait!

19
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,500
Cait, steal!

20
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:54,530
Cait!

21
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:20,740
The world is more UFC.

22
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:24,377
No, it's not like the bad mental
world, but not just as a head.

23
00:01:24,460 --> 00:01:26,457
I was still in the light of the past.

24
00:01:26,540 --> 00:01:27,377
I was not even in the past.

25
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:28,697
I've reached the top of my heart.

26
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:37,360
Oh give it for my way

27
00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:06,500
No way.

28
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,780
He cut through spells.

29
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,360
That's impossible.

30
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:13,551
I didn't know he could do stuff like that.

31
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,920
Now you know.

32
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,340
How'd you do that?

33
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:19,210
Easy.

34
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:22,617
Compared to a bullet from
a high-powered rifle,

35
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:25,157
knocking down high-speed
spells is nothing.

36
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,070
Oh, crap.

37
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:28,420
Battle formation on the double!

38
00:03:34,580 --> 00:03:36,960
I can only hold them for a couple!

39
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:39,180
Head for the boss room! Hurry!

40
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:50,910
Oh yeah?

41
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,177
Hold your ground!

42
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:53,672
There's only one of him!

43
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:55,657
Not even!

44
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:56,940
I'm here too!

45
00:03:57,820 --> 00:04:01,360
You can't see me yet! You're late!

46
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:03,197
What the hell took you so long?

47
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,140
Sorry, man!

48
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,780
Took a wrong turn!

49
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:07,640
Mine's here too?

50
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,780
Thank you, Yui.

51
00:04:15,620 --> 00:04:17,040
You too, Klein.

52
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:21,000
And Kirito, I love you.

53
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:29,337
My friends will take
care of those players.

54
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:31,657
But if we want to get
into the boss room today,

55
00:04:31,740 --> 00:04:34,417
we'll have to get through the
ones blocking it ourselves.

56
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:35,330
Gotcha!

57
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:40,670
Ready?

58
00:04:41,740 --> 00:04:42,600
Yep!

59
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:17,820
Huh?

60
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:37,630
Hey!

61
00:05:37,713 --> 00:05:38,543
Hey, no fair!

62
00:05:48,260 --> 00:05:50,317
Think you can heal them
on your own for a bit?

63
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:52,812
Sure, I should have enough Main for that.

64
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:56,158
Great, then I'm gonna take
care of those enemy mages.

65
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:09,120
Yuki! Watch out!

66
00:06:27,300 --> 00:06:28,880
It's the Berserk Healer!

67
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,560
All right, guys, the hard part's next.

68
00:06:48,180 --> 00:06:51,180
Come on, let's get that boss. Right!

69
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:25,740
Yeah, we will beat him.

70
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:33,340
Okay, drink your potions, guys.

71
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,280
Max out your HP and MP.

72
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:39,553
Stick to the plan and we'll have a shot.

73
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:42,777
We know at the start its
attack patterns are simple.

74
00:07:42,860 --> 00:07:44,331
Stay calm and avoid them.

75
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:50,990
Asuna.

76
00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:52,700
Those guys.

77
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,673
Those friends of yours.

78
00:07:55,220 --> 00:07:57,220
Aren't they here just to help us?

79
00:07:58,940 --> 00:07:59,770
Yes.

80
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:01,757
They know it's important to you.

81
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:05,311
So let's pull this raid off
and make it worth their effort.

82
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,580
Yeah, but...

83
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:11,494
I mean, we can't let you do all this
and not give you anything in return.

84
00:08:14,060 --> 00:08:15,000
But you have.

85
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:18,478
You taught me something I'm
always going to remember.

86
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:22,389
Sometimes you have to fight to
get your point across, right?

87
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:33,757
Well, this is our last chance at this.

88
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,220
Time's running out.

89
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:39,557
It won't be long before that guild regroups
and comes charging through that door.

90
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:44,052
Let's do our best to win, so we can
flash them a victory sign when they do.

91
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,200
Hey, Yuki.

92
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:51,761
When this battle is over, I want
you to tell me all about yourself.

93
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:54,557
I want to know about all
the worlds you've been to,

94
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:56,780
and all the adventures you've had.

95
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,400
Here comes the boss, guys!

96
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,800
Let's mess him up! Right!

97
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,860
Oh, my God.

98
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,360
Say, I feel it!

99
00:10:25,880 --> 00:10:27,280
Only three left.

100
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,540
You guys!

101
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:29,860
We're almost there!

102
00:10:30,140 --> 00:10:31,480
Don't let up on him!

103
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:32,870
Great!

104
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:49,297
That boss sure knows how to defend itself.

105
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:50,777
You think that's a random move?

106
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:52,272
Using his arms to block?

107
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:55,437
Siune, I have an idea
and I need your help.

108
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:57,757
Can you take over healing for 30 seconds?

109
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,717
Yes, that shouldn't be a problem.

110
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:02,212
I have enough reserves to cover everyone.

111
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:20,120
I knew it, that wasn't random, it's protecting
a critical weak spot with that move.

112
00:11:20,340 --> 00:11:21,977
You see that jewel on its chest?

113
00:11:22,060 --> 00:11:23,897
That's where we need to focus our attack.

114
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:26,557
So we just shatter that
jewel and we can defeat it?

115
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:29,346
At the very least, we'll
put a dent in its HP.

116
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:33,854
The thing is, it's too high up to
reach and we can't fly in this dungeon.

117
00:11:34,060 --> 00:11:37,677
Then we'll just use our sword skills
and keep an eye out for counter moves.

118
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,590
Sounds good.

119
00:11:38,673 --> 00:11:40,717
I'll go up front and tell them the plan.

120
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:42,537
Heal them for a little longer, okay?

121
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:43,973
Don't worry, I'm on it.

122
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:48,990
Yuki!

123
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,550
Ashina!

124
00:11:50,633 --> 00:11:52,060
What's going on? Guess what?

125
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:54,177
I found a weak spot on the boss.

126
00:11:54,260 --> 00:11:55,897
You see that jewel on its chest?

127
00:11:55,980 --> 00:11:56,817
Below the necks?

128
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:59,057
If you hit that, you'll
do some major damage.

129
00:11:59,140 --> 00:12:00,040
You sure?

130
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:04,160
Here you go!

131
00:12:04,940 --> 00:12:05,840
It's high!

132
00:12:06,260 --> 00:12:08,436
I couldn't reach it even if I jumped!

133
00:12:10,140 --> 00:12:12,137
You could if you had the
right springboard, though.

134
00:12:12,220 --> 00:12:13,050
Huh?

135
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:19,590
Tenchi!

136
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:23,100
When he swings that
hammer again, take a knee!

137
00:12:29,140 --> 00:12:30,520
It's our chance to win.

138
00:12:30,860 --> 00:12:31,940
Good luck, Yugi!

139
00:12:32,260 --> 00:12:33,480
Leave it to me, sis!

140
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,560
Uh... Sis?

141
00:12:59,140 --> 00:13:00,140
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!

142
00:13:37,540 --> 00:13:38,660
We did it.

143
00:13:39,180 --> 00:13:40,460
You see that?

144
00:13:46,020 --> 00:13:47,280
We beat him, Asuna.

145
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:49,380
That we did.

146
00:13:51,420 --> 00:13:52,760
I'm so tired.

147
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:54,640
We did it.

148
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,960
Yeah, but I'm wiped.

149
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:09,500
Oh my god

150
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:24,180
You you you gotta be kidding me?

151
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:34,300
Great job, you guys.

152
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:37,420
I'm kind of sad it's over.

153
00:14:38,020 --> 00:14:39,720
Oh, it's not over yet.

154
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:42,246
There's one last thing to do.

155
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:45,540
You know, a party.

156
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:48,820
Oh, of course.

157
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,955
Let's have a big one.

158
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:54,640
We'll pull out all the stops. Sweet.

159
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:57,037
We got enough now to
party in style, right?

160
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:57,950
Mm-hmm.

161
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:59,057
Where are we going to have it?

162
00:14:59,140 --> 00:15:02,737
Hey, we should go to some big city and
buy out a restaurant for the night.

163
00:15:02,820 --> 00:15:09,160
Um, actually, if you guys want to,
we could have it at my place in-game.

164
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:12,260
It's small, but cozy. Really?

165
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:17,260
Yuki, is something wrong?

166
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:22,420
Um, please forgive us, Asuna.

167
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:25,701
We really appreciate your
offer to host the party.

168
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:27,720
It's just that...

169
00:15:42,300 --> 00:15:44,020
Oh, never mind. It's nothing.

170
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:48,027
We'd be honored to have our
victory party at your home, Asuna.

171
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,300
That settles it.

172
00:15:51,500 --> 00:15:54,617
Guys, we're heading over to
the Lombard Central Market.

173
00:15:54,700 --> 00:15:56,876
We got ourselves some shopping to do.

174
00:15:58,140 --> 00:15:59,728
Let's get some of that ale!

175
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:06,710
Wow!

176
00:16:06,793 --> 00:16:08,480
Your place is so cool, Asuna!

177
00:16:10,420 --> 00:16:12,980
Wait, there's already food and drinks out!

178
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,777
Now that's what I'm talking about!

179
00:16:15,860 --> 00:16:17,697
I can't wait to get some of these things!

180
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:19,360
It smells so good!

181
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:21,617
Put those over there, yeah?

182
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:22,530
I can't wait!

183
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:36,897
You're not scared of a
little alcohol, are you?

184
00:16:36,980 --> 00:16:39,580
No, I just want to pace myself.

185
00:16:39,860 --> 00:16:43,457
Okay, so the worst MMO
I ever played was...

186
00:16:43,540 --> 00:16:45,097
this one from the U .S.

187
00:16:45,180 --> 00:16:46,298
called Insect Site.

188
00:16:46,580 --> 00:16:48,920
Uh, that one's bad. Really?

189
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,357
Why don't you like it?

190
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,640
Bugs everywhere!

191
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:54,277
If it were just the monsters, no problem!

192
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:56,007
But you gotta play as a bug!

193
00:16:56,500 --> 00:17:00,057
I had to play as a bipedal ant, so
I guess I didn't have it too bad.

194
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:01,846
But you should have seen her.

195
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:02,990
No!

196
00:17:03,073 --> 00:17:04,277
Please don't say anything!

197
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:06,080
She was a giant caterpillar!

198
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:08,020
Spitting silk like whoo!

199
00:17:12,360 --> 00:17:13,260
That's awesome.

200
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:16,757
Sounds like you got to travel to
some really cool places together.

201
00:17:16,840 --> 00:17:17,670
How about you?

202
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:22,260
I mean, you come off like you've
been playing VR Miss forever. Do I?

203
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:25,540
Well, I play this one a lot.

204
00:17:25,860 --> 00:17:30,272
I can't tell you how many hours it took
to get the money to buy this cabin.

205
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,310
Worth it.

206
00:17:32,060 --> 00:17:35,960
You know, when you said this place
was cozy, you weren't kidding.

207
00:17:36,820 --> 00:17:39,400
It's got this really cool old-timey vibe.

208
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:41,060
Yes, it does.

209
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:43,929
It's so peaceful, I
could sit here all day.

210
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:47,598
What's wrong, Sune?

211
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:52,140
I'm so sorry, but I just remembered
when we asked you to help.

212
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:54,797
We said we'd give you whatever
the boss dropped in return.

213
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:59,960
It was money though, and we spent a lot
of it on food and drink for our party.

214
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,820
What have we done?

215
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:08,530
Crap!

216
00:18:08,613 --> 00:18:10,734
Now we don't have anything to give you!

217
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:12,320
No, it's okay.

218
00:18:14,020 --> 00:18:16,280
How about a favor instead?

219
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:17,830
Favor?

220
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:22,567
Honestly, I'm a little
sad the quest is over.

221
00:18:24,280 --> 00:18:26,117
I want to get to know you better, Yuki.

222
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:28,729
There are so many things
I want to ask you.

223
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:33,772
Asuna, sometimes you gotta
fight to get your point across.

224
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:40,320
Yuki, would you let me
join this sleeping night?

225
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:55,740
Asuna, i wish you could, but it's
like this is a temporary thing for us.

226
00:18:56,380 --> 00:18:59,220
And like, come spring
we'll be splitting up.

227
00:19:00,100 --> 00:19:03,897
And after that, i doubt any of
us will be diving much anymore?

228
00:19:03,980 --> 00:19:06,820
I know, but can I join until then?

229
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:08,800
I want us to be friends

230
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:11,576
I want to be friends with all of you.

231
00:19:11,700 --> 00:19:14,524
There's still enough time
for that, isn't there?

232
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:17,230
I...

233
00:19:17,313 --> 00:19:18,220
I'm sorry, Asuna.

234
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:20,960
You can't. Sorry.

235
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:24,160
Not at all.

236
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:25,300
It's fine.

237
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:28,037
I shouldn't have put you on
the spot like that, Yuki.

238
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:28,950
I'm sorry.

239
00:19:32,060 --> 00:19:33,017
Um, Asuna...

240
00:19:33,100 --> 00:19:34,717
I don't...

241
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:36,217
you see, we...

242
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:37,200
No, really.

243
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:38,597
You don't have to be.

244
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,960
Sorry I was so pushy.

245
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:41,541
Anyway, come on.

246
00:19:41,700 --> 00:19:42,994
Let's go check it out.

247
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:44,110
What?

248
00:19:44,193 --> 00:19:46,177
The reason we beat the boss, remember?

249
00:19:46,260 --> 00:19:49,084
You know, the monument
in the Black Iron Palace.

250
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:52,720
I'm sure it's been updated
by now. Yeah, guys. Let's go.

251
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,377
Oh, know what we should do?

252
00:19:55,460 --> 00:19:57,037
We should take our picture with it.

253
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:59,440
Good idea. Best one yet. Oh, my gosh.

254
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:00,830
Come on, guys.

255
00:20:00,940 --> 00:20:01,770
Let's go.

256
00:20:01,853 --> 00:20:02,880
Hey, let's go.

257
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:07,517
All right, let's do it.

258
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:08,894
Let's get out of here.

259
00:20:09,100 --> 00:20:09,930
I can't wait.

260
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:22,680
There it is!

261
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:26,180
Hey, wait for me! Look!

262
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:28,430
Look.

263
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:34,790
Up there.

264
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:44,780
There we are.

265
00:20:45,100 --> 00:20:46,980
We got our names on it.

266
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:52,600
Hey, guys!

267
00:20:52,860 --> 00:20:54,272
Let's take that picture!

268
00:20:56,020 --> 00:20:57,820
Come on, Yuki. Big smile.

269
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:23,380
There it is. You did it.

270
